#: ../developer/configuration.md:450
msgid ""
"The registry on the Overview tab lists every provider the gateway can "
"route to, but only *custom* providers are editable there. A provider that"
" code or the model registry already owns — the built-in adapter kinds, "
"and any `provider:` label a route declares — is read-only in this table, "
"and a stored definition that reuses one of those slugs is skipped at boot"
" rather than allowed to shadow it. Custom providers are `openai_compat` "
"only; a protocol the generic adapter cannot speak needs an adapter, which"
" is a code change ([Adding a New Provider](adding-models.md#adding-a-new-"
"provider))."
msgstr "Overview 标签页上的注册表列出网关能路由到的每一个 provider，但只有*自定义*的 provider 在那里可编辑。代码或模型注册表已经拥有的 provider——内置的适配器 kind，以及路由声明的任何 `provider:` 标签——在这张表里是只读的；一条复用了这些 slug 的已存定义在启动时会被跳过，而不是被允许遮蔽它。自定义 provider 只能是 `openai_compat`；通用适配器说不了的协议需要一个适配器，那是代码改动（[添加新 provider](adding-models.md#adding-a-new-provider)）。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:459
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"A key added here joins the same pool as the keys the registry names "
"through `${VAR}` and rotates with them. An environment key has no row of "
"its own, so the console can disable it or reserve it for a tier but "
"cannot delete it; unset the variable and restart for that."
msgstr "在这里添加的 key 会进入注册表用 `${VAR}` 指名的那些 key 所在的同一个池子，并与它们一起轮换。环境变量 key 没有自己的行，所以控制台能禁用它、能把它预留给某个层级，但不能删除它；要删就把变量去掉再重启。"

